  "effect_entries": [
    {
      "effect": "Permet au joueur de se déplacer rapidement et hors des sentiers battus.",
      "short_effect": "Permet au joueur de se déplacer rapidement et hors des sentiers battus.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "Allows the player to move quickly and off the grid.",
      "short_effect": "Allows the player to move quickly and off the grid.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "クツぞこに　ローラーが　ついている。\nじめんを　かっそう　したり\nトリックプレイを　きめたりできる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "신발 바닥에 롤러가 달려 있다.\n지면을 활주하거나\n트릭플레이를 할 수 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Aussi connus sous le nom de patins à roulettes,\nils permettent de se déplacer rapidement\net éventuellement de réaliser des figures.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Schuhe mit Rädern an der Sohle. Mit ihnen kannst\ndu über den Boden rollen und Tricks ausführen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una de las misteriosas Megapiedras. Permite\nmegaevolucionar a Mewtwo en combate.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pattini applicati alla suola delle scarpe.\nPermettono di pattinare e di eseguire figure.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Attaches roller skates to the bottom\nof your shoes, allowing you to glide\nquickly around and perform tricks.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
